  "id": "sexual-selection",
  "term": "sexual selection",
  "definition": "Sexual selection is an evolutionary process in which reproductive success is shaped by competition for access to breeding opportunities or resources. It can produce very uneven mating success, with some males gaining many matings, and has often been discussed in terms of female choice and male dominance.",
